# INVWINCC.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: Import CSV and
# the levels.  At level 3 the file name dialog lists the files *.CSV;
# TEST/WIN/IMPMIX.CSV, chosen, goes into the form, where LOCS is chosen
# with its field names line.  The question before the import, No going
# back to the form, then Yes: its good and bad lines are refused all
# together, the bad ones listed in a message box with their count, and
# the form stays.  A file that does not exist, typed into the form, is
# refused on its field; TEST/WIN/IMPLOC.CSV, good lines only, is added,
# its message box saying how many, and the locations show the new ones.
# At level 2 both entries are grayed, and their keys in the open menu
# give nothing; the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINCC.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-A M
S NAME
K TAB HOME DOWN
S CHOSEN
K ENTER
S FORM
K DOWN TAB TAB SPACE ENTER
S ASK
K N
S KEPT
K ENTER Y
S REFUSED
K ENTER
S STAYED
T C:\RUN\NONE.CSV
K ENTER Y
S NOFILE
T C:\RUN\IMPLOC.CSV
K ENTER Y
S ADDED
K ENTER ALT-L B
S LOCS
K ALT-F L STAB
T CLERK
K TAB
T Clerk1986
K ENTER ALT-A
S MENU
K E
S NOEXPORT
K ALT-A M
S NOIMPORT
K ALT-F X
